## BUILD & DEPLOY

```bash
# 1. Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/traccar/traccar.git
cd traccar

# 2. Apply the patches above

# 3. Build
./gradlew clean build

# 4. Deploy (Linux)
sudo systemctl stop traccar
sudo cp build/libs/tracker-server.jar /opt/traccar/tracker-server.jar
sudo systemctl start traccar

# 5. Deploy (Windows)
# Stop Traccar service
# Copy build\libs\tracker-server.jar to C:\Program Files\Traccar\
# Start Traccar service
```

